      },
      "text": "The transfer to the airport takes about **40 minutes**. Fly to Trelew.\n\nOn arrival, transfer to the Valdés Peninsula, a journey of about **1 hour**. Check in at **Hotel Territorio**.\n\nThis leg of the trip focuses on the marine wildlife of Patagonia’s Atlantic coast."
