      },
      "text": "Valdés Peninsula"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:49b18e3fb3f9ec7b",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e5a8021aa1fd15439996544a30e751317f3060552cd405e1f611dc14af58a940",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "submit-9e9cff89-eaf8-4da3-b719-163cca50324d-04",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "The excursion around the Valdés Peninsula takes about **7 hours**.\n\nThe day focuses on watching marine wildlife. Depending on the season and with a bit of luck, you may see fur seals and whales.\n\nYou’ll spend most of the day on the open coast, where the steppe meets the ocean. The timing and viewing spots depend on natural conditions."
    },
